    {
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "text": "Extra fork child: P2 forks two ways although it holds only its own token number",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontStyle": 1,
      "color": -16777216
    },
    {
      "x": 40,
      "y": 62,
      "text": "P1 forks 01 to P2 and 02 to P3. P2's second child needs a number it does not hold and takes 02, while P1's 02 waits at P3's join.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontStyle": 0,
      "color": -16777216
    },
    {
      "x": 40,
      "y": 80,
      "text": "P3 renames the newer arrival (02 -> 03) instead of letting one replace the other; P5 joins both branches and the workflow ends.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontStyle": 0,
      "color": -16777216
    }
  ],
